Horde NPC Ability Learn Warlock
    Events
        Unit - A unit Gains a level
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Warlock (Companion - Orc)
    Actions
        Set VariableSet RandNumberAbility = (Random integer number between 1 and 7)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                RandNumberAbility Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                -------- BANISH --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Level of HeroWarlock_Banish  for (Triggering unit)) Equal to 0
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Add HeroWarlock_Banish  to (Triggering unit)
                    Else - Actions
                        Unit - Set level of HeroWarlock_Banish  for (Triggering unit) to ((Level of HeroWarlock_Banish  for (Triggering unit)) + 1)
